# CITATION.cff
# Citation metadata for this repository, in Citation File Format 1.2.0
# (https://citation-file-format.github.io). GitHub reads this file and shows a
# "Cite this repository" button that generates APA and BibTeX entries.
#
# Before publishing, replace the placeholders:
#   - repository-code: <your-username> -> your GitHub username
#   - authors: <Your Family Name> / <Your Given Name> -> your real name
#
# When you tag a new release, update "version" and "date-released".
# The "license" value must match the LICENSE file (MIT).
# The "references" section credits the TinyStories and SimpleStories papers
# that this project builds on. It is not the preferred citation for this repository.